  "take": "e2bae04d-1fc0319d.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "70c8fc6a",
  "who": "grandpa",
  "text": "I know that walk. That’s the delivery boy. Forty minutes late, and the pizza was cold.",
  "exaggeration": 0.85,
  "cfg": 0.4,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "70c8fc6a-e0339bba.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "06b5a1ef",
  "who": "grandpa",
  "text": "This is about that damn rating, isn’t it? Lucia. What did you write about him?",
  "exaggeration": 1.05,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "06b5a1ef-9f0b7092.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "5686916c",
  "who": "grandpa",
  "text": "Oh, so now you listen to me? Now?",
  "exaggeration": 0.95,
  "cfg": 0.4,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "5686916c-8f8356a7.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "73c6daa7",
  "who": "dad",
  "text": "Enough! Both of you, stop it.",
  "exaggeration": 1.1,
  "cfg": 0.4,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "73c6daa7-56b3cbe4.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "1557a964",
  "who": "uncle",
  "text": "Yeah? Go tell that to the psycho in the cheese suit.",
  "exaggeration": 0.85,
  "cfg": 0.42,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "1557a964-ec8ff853.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "8ba77637",
  "who": "dad",
  "text": "No. Mija, no. Look at me. This is not on you, okay? It’s not.",
  "exaggeration": 0.9,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "8ba77637-dcf95818.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "337ed68e",
  "who": "grandpa",
  "text": "Nothing to say? Typical.",
  "exaggeration": 0.7,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "337ed68e-0355084d.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "2f89f3ee",
  "who": "dad",
  "text": "Alex. Alex, look at me. Whatever he brings you, you check it first. Every bite. No seeds, okay?",
  "exaggeration": 0.9,
  "cfg": 0.38,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "2f89f3ee-070e9a9b.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "24f8f6c9",
  "who": "alex",
  "text": "I know, Dad. I know. I’m not a baby.",
  "exaggeration": 0.85,
  "cfg": 0.4,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "24f8f6c9-d0613677.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "5be4e2e9",
  "who": "ruben",
  "text": "Okay. Horror movie rules. Rule one, never split up. Rule two… I don’t remember rule two.",
  "exaggeration": 1.0,
